  "limits": [
    "Three repeated starts, no forced cold filesystem cache. The marker measures app first draw, not panel scanout.",
    "Headless compositors use software Mesa at 1280x720 in Debian/WSL; the native sample is a separate no-NIC 1280x800 QEMU/KVM guest. Their start times are not a hardware ranking.",
    "RSS sums complete process trees and can double-count shared pages; protected-reader PSS is unavailable.",
    "Each compositor retains 36 key and capture-overhead observations, rounded to 0.001 ms. The summary pools all 36 values; capture overhead is included, not subtracted.",
    "The tool does not use privileged helpers. Only its private headless fixture skips native-colour preparation; physical trials do not.",
    "Packages are unsigned measurement artifacts without account configuration. Debian compositor/Mesa installation costs are separate.",
    "HP Stream latency, colour, power and day-of-writing checks remain pending. Direct DRM latency needs a physical measurement."
  ]
